      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. one more thing—can you expand a bit on the management part? i want to explain why someone might choose active management even if the fees are higher. also are there any typical \"hidden\" issues with how these are priced or managed that i should warn the client about?",
      "source": "evaluator"
